<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαφ-ίημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send forth, discharge,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλτόν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				12.12
			</span></i>; <i>dispatch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γροσφομάχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.39.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>let go</i> an elastic board, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>set free from,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαφεῖται τοῦδε</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πονεῖν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				72
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				18.1.1
			</span></i>; <i>set free,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. σῶον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ma.</u>
					12.24
				</span></i>
			; <i>let loose,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγέλας εἰς καρπούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLips.</u>
					35.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be allowed to escape,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.6.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>squander,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					156
				</span></i>
			.</div>
